{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1273.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e","ja":"数日後……","zh":"几天后……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1273.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"c5713f46fa9895ff23c45ce2575f9d4b8f8bfa96ed64e72bba52e54804c6bb8f","ja":"ふわぁ～……。\nあ、お疲れさまでーす♪","zh":"哈啊～……。\n啊，辛苦啦～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1273.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"dde07a63c5faead80689ad229ed61745d670c22ae1eb73cc431b25ee366a980e","ja":"お疲れさま。えっと……麗花ちゃん、\n今日も飲み会？　最近、よく行ってるような気が……。","zh":"辛苦了。那个……丽花，\n今天也有酒会吗？感觉你最近经常去呢……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1273.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"e15d6cab3d2a558d94d8676cc025c159bbf3057d4dba7300df302f5cd6cd4ffb","ja":"はい、そうですね！\nほぼ毎日、居酒屋さんに通ってます♪","zh":"是的，没错！\n我几乎每天都会去居酒屋♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1273.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"3ae275cf458fcb83c20b9d12fc39f7e6c483bfcc5548d86e61385e8ba29dd889","ja":"麗花……お酒の飲みすぎは体に障るかと。","zh":"丽花……酒喝太多会有损身体健康的。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1273.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"776d155ded0007957d4ff67272872a62f024f338c62c475763cfa35ed73a7455","ja":"うん。それに麗花ちゃんここのところずっと\n眠そうだし……やっぱり心配だよ。","zh":"嗯。而且丽花最近看起来一直很困……\n果然还是会担心啊。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1273.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"b8618d3057249419405d94d58ddf8f0c45427638746ccbe0989b70f63a08130d","ja":"言われてみれば確かにあんまり寝てないかも？\nでも見ての通り、私は元気い～っぱいですよ♪","zh":"经你这么一说，好像确实没怎么睡？\n不过正如你所见，我可是精力充～沛呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1273.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"44a03b2e5eb5cf599557226c5500066de919b9c61f8ef121c89cf31d0ee299bc","ja":"しかし……\n自身の疲れに無自覚なこともあるのでは？","zh":"但是……\n会不会有时自己也没有察觉到疲劳呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1273.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"c24834cfd4a611c06e2a7c63de1b872a934802d498116d0fe260e17243020db0","ja":"そうね……麗花ちゃん！\n大学のお付き合いもあるんだろうけど……。","zh":"也是呢……丽花！\n虽然大学里大概也有人际交往要顾及……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1273.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"408409cd5e4855f4f37932b13b60dd707d8fb4941ee4653574d26732ece2af38","ja":"飲み会はほどほどにした方が良いわよ。\n睡眠不足もお酒の飲み過ぎも、体に良くは……。","zh":"酒会还是适度一点比较好哦。\n睡眠不足和饮酒过量，都对身体不……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1273.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"0ea7542e8fdcb4feb2fc086fb5e5a2e790657469301f4544ad54afb2d9e47e7b","ja":"えっ？　私、最近、全然お酒飲んでないですよ？","zh":"咦？我最近完全没喝酒哦？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1273.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"5739a56734c2fb2eb81d1a02d4a206d77744700f40aeb06ea91f31a39202e41c","ja":"だから、毎日飲むんじゃなくて、\nちゃんと休肝日とかも考えて……。","zh":"所以，不能每天都喝，\n也要好好考虑设个休肝日之类的……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1273.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"c7a53d128a6114e1bca27af37a01b5092e233a4dd035b5eb34b0e191a9e1902e","ja":"……えっ！？","zh":"……诶！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1273.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"cef7e4ff85a1c2d1414d6d0c7f6985d2a73843121177cf1c4956199fcff9ae25","ja":"はて、どういうことでしょう？","zh":"哎呀，这是怎么回事呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
